        "### Relations: ConvMem (arXiv:2609.10441) x All Previous Papers (standing rule: every new paper gets this cell)",
        "",
        "- **vs LayerMix (arXiv:2608.28930, s10-12): STACK (untested).** ConvMem's hierarchy emits per-layer summaries H^(l,c) - layered states a probe can score, and sub-answers a probe can grade for faithfulness (mirrors the Levni-typo test). Open experiment: LayerMix top-K over ConvMem layers instead of transformer layers. No conflict (different stages: hierarchy produces, probes observe).",
        "- **vs SABER (arXiv:2608.27963, s13): STACK (untested).** SABER early-exit gating wraps ConvMem generations: exit a channel's recursion once its sub-answer stabilizes (RSS on branch probes of the channel). Both training-free inference-side; no shared state. Recorded in both compat cells.",
