        "- **vs Attention (arXiv:1706.03762) + BERT (arXiv:1810.04805, graded-only): NONE.** Reference papers with no notebook runtime surface; ConvMem assumes any backbone (Fig.3 model-agnosticism) including the Attn:: variants, which is composition by design, not a relation to maintain.",
